% [oracle, OURS] KLIC entry point for cd_r8.kl1: the Listener's goal of
% APPS pkl1_cd, count_down(1000), which binds nothing.  The two goals
% run concurrently, so `done` does not show that count_down ended; what
% does is that the program exits 0 with no failure message (a reduction
% failure is reported by KLIC's runtime and the exit is not 0; checked
% with count_down(-1), which no clause takes: see README.md)
:- module main.
main :-
	count_down:count_down(1000),
	io:outstream([print(done), nl]).
